# Gaussian splatting: private, under NDA. The player, its shader, the hand
# grab that drives it and the offline converter stay out of this repository,
# so the rest of the piece can be versioned without them. The project will not
# compile from a fresh clone until they are put back by hand.
Assets/Scripts/VFX/SplatSequencePlayer.cs
Assets/Scripts/VFX/SplatSequencePlayer.cs.meta
Assets/Scripts/VFX/SplatHandGrab.cs
Assets/Scripts/VFX/SplatHandGrab.cs.meta
Assets/Shaders/GaussianSplats.shader
Assets/Shaders/GaussianSplats.shader.meta
Tools/SplatSequence/

# Captures and converted sequences live outside the project, in
# ../IMETINHUMAN_Media, and are pushed to the headset over USB.

# The dark-room reflection drives the splat player and mirrors its splats, so
# it belongs with the private work rather than here.
Assets/Scripts/VFX/DarkRoom.cs
Assets/Scripts/VFX/DarkRoom.cs.meta

# Media: models, captures, audio and video are large and live with the artist,
# not in version control. Code, shaders, scenes and project settings only.
